=\"3749\" data-end=\"3782\"><strong data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3780\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Tiered Commission Structure</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3829\">$2,000+ in sales: 16% commission (monthly)</li><li data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3876\">$5,000+ in sales: 17% commission (monthly)</li></ul><p data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3916\"><strong data-start=\"3878\" data-end=\"3914\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Why Promote STEREOWOOD Products?</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3960\">Premium patented designs that stand out</li><li data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3996\">Handcrafted by skilled artisans</li><li data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4042\">Eco-friendly &amp; sustainable linden plywood</li><li data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4098\">Durable, long-lasting, and stain-resistant finishes</li><li data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4138\">Extended warranty for peace of mind</li><li data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4188\">Perfect centerpiece décor for any modern home</li></ul><p data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4212\"><strong data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4210\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Our Product Line</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4236\">3D Layered Wall Art</li><li data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4265\">3D Decorative Sculptures</li><li data-start=\"4268\" data-end=\"4292\">Layered Wood Furniture</li><li data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4307\">Gift Cards</li></ul><p data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4457\"><strong data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4326\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Payment Terms</span></strong><br data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4329\">Commissions are paid on a Net-30 basis, after the 30-day return/exchange window has passed. Payments are processed via PayPal or Wise.</p></div>",
